  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Nanay’s Laundry Report",
    "overview": "The existing world is a Filipino rooftop pixel arcade: expressive original character art, pixel type, square outlines and tactile block shadows. This document records the shipped end-of-run surface, rather than prescribing new compositions for gameplay or other screens.\n\nThe results surface turns Nanay’s judgment into a cream sheet clipped to a clothesline. A dim pre-rendered rooftop covers the finished game completely. The portrait, commentary and crooked grade stamp introduce the verdict; score and dry laundry dominate the tally. English and Tagalog share this structure.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Original pixel portraits and rooftop artwork.",
      "Cream paper with blue ink and ruled statistics.",
      "Dominant score pair, six supporting tallies.",
      "Yellow replay and pale title actions outside the sheet."
    ],
